[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 30.0,
    "text": "欢迎来到深度学习的世界。今天,我们将一起揭开神经网络的神秘面纱。探索这项驱动了现代人工智能的核心技术。你是否曾经好奇过?那一串串冰冷的代码和组成的计算机代码?究竟是如何像人类大脑一样?学会识别照片、理解语言?甚至进行创作的呢?科学家们从生物学中寻找灵感,试图在计算机中模拟人类大脑神经元的工作方式。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "text": "我们需要从最基础的单元,神经元开始讲起,要理解人工神经网络。我们首先要看看大自然的设计,生物神经元。这是人类大脑中数以百亿的基本工作单元。尽管它的内部结构及其复杂,但我们可以将其抽象为四个关键部分。首先是树突,他们就像是神经元的天线,负责接收来自其他神经元的化学或电信号。接着是细胞体,它是神经元的控制中心,会对所有接受到的",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 86.0,
    "text": "信号进行汇总和处理。然后是轴突。一旦信号被处理完毕,它就会沿着这条细长的管道向外传递。最后是突触,它是神经元之间交接的关口,负责将信号跨过缝隙传递给下一个神经元。让我们观察一次完整的信号传递,信号由树突进入,经过细胞体的整合,最后通过轴突奔向下一个目标。但并不是所有的信号都能顺利传递。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 86.0,
    "end": 96.0,
    "text": "这里有一个核心机制,阈值,只有当输入信号的强度累积超过了某个特定的阈值时,神经元才会被点亮,并向下发送信号。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 115.8,
    "text": "这种全或无的工作方式,正是现代神经网络逻辑的基础,现在我们将生物神经元抽象为数学模型。这就是神经网络的鼻祖,感知机、Perceptron。它是人类模仿大脑,尝试迈出的第一步,将复杂的生物电信号简化成了纯粹的数学运算。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 115.8,
    "end": 124.4,
    "text": "在这个结构中,左侧是我们的输入信号,每一个信号进入时都会被赋予一个权重,Weight,用来代表该信号的重要性。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 124.4,
    "end": 133.6,
    "text": "随后所有加权后的信号会在细胞中心进行累加,并加上一个偏置,Bias,这个偏置决定了神经元被激活的难易程度。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 133.6,
    "end": 143.8,
    "text": "将其写成公式就是输入与权重的点积求和,加上偏置,最后通过一个激活函数F,其中X是输入,W是权重,B是偏置,",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 143.8,
    "end": 146.8,
    "text": "而F,则是决定最终输出的激活函数。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 146.8,
    "end": 156.2,
    "text": "为了更好理解,我们来看一个经典的逻辑运算,与门与门,只有当两个输入同时为一时输出才为一,",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 156.2,
    "end": 168.8,
    "text": "我们可以通过设定参数来实现它,令权重W为一,偏置B为负1.5,这样,只有当X1和X2都为一时总和2加偏置,负1.5才大于0,",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 169.8,
    "end": 177.8,
    "text": "从而触发输出,感知机就这样学会了简单的逻辑判断,感知机虽然强大,但它只能处理线性可分的问题,如与门。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 177.8,
    "end": 181.8,
    "text": "如果问题变得更加复杂,单层感知机还够用吗?",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 181.8,
    "end": 191.8,
    "text": "如果说神经元是神经网络的细胞,那么激活函数就是这些细胞的灵魂,你可能会问,为什么我们不能直接输出求和的结果,非要加上一层复杂的函数变化呢?",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 191.8,
    "end": 205.8,
    "text": "关键在于非线性,当Linearity,如果没有激活函数,无论你的神经网络有多少层,它在数学上都只能等同于一个简单的线性模型,只有引入了非线性,神经网络才能去拟合和现实世界中各种复杂的不规则的规律。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 205.8,
    "end": 208.8,
    "text": "首先是最简单的阶约寒数,Stab方向。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 208.8,
    "end": 213.8,
    "text": "它的逻辑非常果断,信号一旦超过预值就输出1,否则就是0。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 213.8,
    "end": 226.8,
    "text": "这虽然简单,但因为不可倒,在现代训练中很少使用。接着是经典的sigma的寒数,它像一个平化的s能将任何数值压缩到0到1之间,它是神经网络早期最常用的激活寒数。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 226.8,
    "end": 235.8,
    "text": "随后是tan的寒数,它的形状与sigma的类似,但它能输出复职,范围在复1到1之间让数据的均值更接近0。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 235.8,
    "end": 247.8,
    "text": "最后是目前工业界最宠爱的relu。在副区间它完全静默,在正区间它现性爆发,它的计算极其简单,却能显住加速网络的训练。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 247.8,
    "end": 256.8,
    "text": "这四种寒数代表了神经网络对信号处理的不同态度,有了他们,神经网络才真正具备了学习复杂逻辑的能力。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 256.8,
    "end": 262.8,
    "text": "现在我们既有了神经园,又有了激活寒数,事实后把他们大规模地组织起来了。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 262.8,
    "end": 271.8,
    "text": "单个神经园的能力是有限的,但当成千商万个神经园连接在一起时,奇迹就发生了,这就是深度神经网络。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 271.8,
    "end": 277.8,
    "text": "在这个复杂的网络中,每一个节点都在处理信息,每一根连线都代表着知识的权重。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 277.8,
    "end": 287.8,
    "text": "典型的结构分为三部分,输入层接收原始数据,输出层给出最终结果,而中间这些神秘的隐藏层,则是模型进行抽象思考的核心地带。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 287.8,
    "end": 291.8,
    "text": "那么神经网络是如何工作的呢,这一切都是于潜向传播。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 291.8,
    "end": 297.8,
    "text": "Forward Propagation,数据从左侧输入,像潮水一样,主层向右勇动。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 297.8,
    "end": 302.8,
    "text": "每一层的神经园都会根据上一层的输出进行计算,并将激活后的信号传递给下一层。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 302.8,
    "end": 308.8,
    "text": "经过多层隐藏层的非现性变换,复杂的原始输入会被一步步抽象,体练。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 308.8,
    "end": 314.8,
    "text": "最终网络在输出层给出了它的判断,这就是神经网络模拟大脑进行推理的基本逻辑。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 314.8,
    "end": 319.8,
    "text": "当然，隐藏层的数量越多，网络就越深，能够理解的特征也就越复杂。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 319.8,
    "end": 325.8,
    "text": "了解了整体结构后，我们来拆解数据，在网络中流动的精确逻辑，前向传播。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 325.8,
    "end": 328.8,
    "text": "为了清晰起见，我们来看一个精简版的模型。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 328.8,
    "end": 331.8,
    "text": "在这里，每一层都在完成一次华丽的数学变换。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 331.8,
    "end": 336.8,
    "text": "在计算机眼中，这些神经元并不是杂乱无章的点，而是整齐的矩阵。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 336.8,
    "end": 341.8,
    "text": "每一层的计算本质上都是一次矩阵乘法，加上偏置，在经过激活函数处理。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 341.8,
    "end": 347.8,
    "text": "举个具体的数值例子，假设我们将一组由0.5,0.3,0.8组成的信号输入进第一层。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 347.8,
    "end": 350.8,
    "text": "此时，输入层的神经元被激活。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 350.8,
    "end": 355.8,
    "text": "它们将这些原始数据推向下一个阶段，每一条权重线上的权重会与输入相乘并相加。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 355.8,
    "end": 361.8,
    "text": "得到一个中间结果，Z，紧接着，激活函数Sigma会给这个结果注入非线性的力量。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 361.8,
    "end": 367.8,
    "text": "隐藏层接收到了经过深度学习后的特征，并再次将它们进行加权组合传递给最后的一层。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 367.8,
    "end": 377.8,
    "text": "最终所有的信息收集在输出层，得到的结果就是神经网络基于当前知识对输入数据给出的预测答案。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 377.8,
    "end": 384.8,
    "text": "前向传播得到了预测值。但如果预测错了怎么办，这就需要引入损失函数。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 384.8,
    "end": 392.8,
    "text": "简单来说，损失函数就像是一个严格的教练，它负责精准地衡量预测值与真实标签之间的差距。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 392.8,
    "end": 402.8,
    "text": "最常用的是均方误差MSE。它通过计算差值的平方来放大那些严重的错误，常用于回归任务中预测连续的数值。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 402.8,
    "end": 409.8,
    "text": "而在分类任务中,我们常用交叉熵Cross Entropy。它对概率分布的微小差异非常敏感。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 409.8,
    "end": 419.8,
    "text": "能让模型在分类时更加果断。如果我们将模型的所有参数看作标量,损失的大小看作高度,就会得到一张损失面。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 419.8,
    "end": 423.8,
    "text": "这个曲面中最低点就代表了损失最小,预测最准的最优解。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 423.8,
    "end": 429.8,
    "text": "所以训练神经网络的核心目标,就是在这个起伏的曲面上寻找那条通向底部的路径。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 429.8,
    "end": 434.8,
    "text": "最小化损失函数,既然知道了差距,接下来就是最关键的一步。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 434.8,
    "end": 437.8,
    "text": "神经网络是如何根据错误来修正自己的。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 437.8,
    "end": 440.8,
    "text": "这就是著名的反向传播算法。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 440.8,
    "end": 444.8,
    "text": "反向传播的核心在于数学中的链式法则,顺藤摸瓜。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 444.8,
    "end": 450.8,
    "text": "它像波阳从一样,将最后的总误差层层拆解,分配到每一个权重上。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 450.8,
    "end": 456.8,
    "text": "让我们回到这个三层的小型网络中,在前向传播中,数据从左向右流动产生误差。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 456.8,
    "end": 463.8,
    "text": "紧接着,反向传播开始了逆向传播,也就是修正建议,从右侧的输出层出发逆流而上。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 463.8,
    "end": 469.8,
    "text": "这种传播会逐层评估每一个神经元对最终误差的贡献度,误差越大,得到的修正信号就越强。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 469.8,
    "end": 474.8,
    "text": "最后,根据计算出的梯度,网络会微调所有的权重,",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 474.8,
    "end": 478.8,
    "text": "每个权重减去学习率乘以梯度,就得到了更新后的新权重。",
    "visual_text": "",
    "ocr_text": "",
    "formula_latex": [],
    "chart_data": [],
    "scene_type": "unknown",
    "visual_confidence": 0.0,
    "has_visual": false
  },
  {
    "start": 478.8,
    "end": 484.8,
    "text": "每一轮这样的循环,网络都会变得更聪明一点,这就是神经网络学习的本质。",
